//
// ⚠ **THE ORDER IS THE ENUM'S, NOT THE BOOTSTRAP COMMENT'S.** `2-Parser.cs:1442-1444` lists SEVEN and omits
// `iteratorInvalid`, which would shift every later ordinal by one. It is the third reference comment found
